  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Myriad Year Flying Warship has four main killer moves: torrential charge, daybreak sword, daybreak torrent, and myriad year hunting. Every one of those killer moves is rank eight. In Western Desert, without the River of Time’s amplification, the warship’s killer moves only have normal strength.",
      "chapters": [
        1872
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship",
        "reg_western_desert",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Twelve Zodiac battle formation merges into Myriad Year Flying Warship as a golden helm, Fang Yuan activates Daybreak Torrent. The warship swoops down and leaves a trail of sonic booms. The house was already an outstanding rank eight Immortal Gu House, and the merged formation possessed strength that could match Duke Long; after they merged, their strength combined to a horrifying level. Duke Long unleashes a qi wall. The warship’s momentum slows slightly, then it breaks the wall. He raises the wall again and the warship breaks it again. After five times, the warship’s momentum falls sharply. Fang Yuan then activates myriad year hunting, a separate killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        1943
